WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.237 --> 00:00:02.565
The Bear and the Bee

00:00:04.656 --> 00:00:08.235
(A version of the tale by TheFableCottage.com)

00:00:10.306 --> 00:00:13.822
Everybody knows that bears love honey.

00:00:14.966 --> 00:00:21.470
One day Mr Bear looks in his cupboard
and he can't find any honey.

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:26.783
"Oh no! No honey!" he says.

00:00:27.186 --> 00:00:30.510
So he goes into the forest to find some.

00:00:33.559 --> 00:00:36.344
He sees a beehive in a tree.

00:00:36.914 --> 00:00:38.914
He smells the honey.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.614
"Mmmmm! Honey!"

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.375
He sticks his paw into the beehive and…

00:00:45.426 --> 00:00:47.961
ZZZZZZZZZ!

00:00:48.151 --> 00:00:50.151
A bee flies out.

00:00:50.787 --> 00:00:54.313
“Hey, bear! Go away!” says the bee.

00:00:54.802 --> 00:00:57.014
"This is not your honey!"

00:00:57.773 --> 00:00:59.773
Mr Bear is annoyed.

00:01:00.148 --> 00:01:03.261
“I am bigger than you,” he says.

00:01:03.692 --> 00:01:06.478
“And I am stronger than you too.

00:01:06.527 --> 00:01:08.527
I can do what I want!

00:01:08.527 --> 00:01:10.114
Now... buzz off!”

00:01:10.984 --> 00:01:15.043
Mr Bear sticks his paw into the beehive again and…

00:01:15.145 --> 00:01:18.808
ZZZZZZZZZ!  ZING!

00:01:19.047 --> 00:01:20.104
OWIE!

00:01:20.243 --> 00:01:23.546
The bee stings him right on his nose!

00:01:24.432 --> 00:01:26.814
“My nose! My nose!

00:01:26.814 --> 00:01:31.821
Oooh... I'm so angry!" growls Mr Bear.

00:01:32.376 --> 00:01:34.593
He finds a big stick.

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:36.593
He tries to hit the bee.

00:01:36.975 --> 00:01:41.485
He swings and he swings,
but the bee is too fast!

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:45.847
Mr Bear gets angrier and angrier.

00:01:46.097 --> 00:01:51.696
"GARRRRRGHH! I WILL SQUASH YOU!
COME HERE!"

00:01:51.791 --> 00:01:54.511
The bee flies back into the beehive.

00:01:55.254 --> 00:01:59.797
"AH HAH! Now you're trapped!" yells Mr Bear.

00:02:00.221 --> 00:02:03.069
He swings his stick at the beehive.

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:05.914
Smash! Smash! Smash!

00:02:05.914 --> 00:02:08.454
He smashes it to pieces!

00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:11.774
Then he hears a strange sound.

00:02:12.564 --> 00:02:15.698
It gets louder and louder…

00:02:16.379 --> 00:02:22.526
ZZZZ! ZZZZ! ZZZ! Zzzz!
ZZZZZZZZZZ! Zzzz! ZZZZ!

00:02:22.526 --> 00:02:26.458
Thousands of bees fly out
of the smashed beehive.

00:02:26.902 --> 00:02:29.633
They fly around Mr Bear's head…

00:02:30.913 --> 00:02:34.697
ZZZZZZZZZ… ZING!
They sting him on his ear.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:38.729
ZING ZING!
They sting him on his elbow.

00:02:39.663 --> 00:02:42.216
They chase Mr Bear through the forest.

00:02:42.352 --> 00:02:46.560
They sting him on his arms,
his legs, his hands...

00:02:46.788 --> 00:02:49.182
... and especially on his nose.

00:02:49.329 --> 00:02:50.970
ZING! ZING! ZING!

00:02:51.569 --> 00:02:57.340
Mr Bear runs all the way home
and slams the door shut. BAM!

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:01.500
Then he hears a voice behind him.

00:03:02.147 --> 00:03:03.787
It’s Mrs. Bear.

00:03:04.221 --> 00:03:07.838
“You did it again, didn’t you?” she says.

00:03:08.105 --> 00:03:10.278
“You lost your temper.”

00:03:10.585 --> 00:03:15.731
“Yes,” he says as he cries
and counts his bee stings.

00:03:16.543 --> 00:03:20.457
“Here’s the bee-sting medicine,”
says Mrs. Bear.

00:03:20.629 --> 00:03:23.275
“Also, we have honey in the cupboard.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.480
It’s behind the flour.”

00:03:27.728 --> 00:03:32.745
Moral: A hot temper always
gets you into trouble.

